        "text": "<p><strong>Up to 70% off for a limited time</strong></p><p>Every year, for just a few days, we mark the month when Julia & Anne first began. What started as a shared dream between two sisters twenty years ago has grown slowly over time, shaped by the women who choose to wear our dresses.</p><p>This limited sale isn’t about clearing stock. It’s simply our way of celebrating where we started and saying thank you for being part of our story.</p>",
